{"exclude": "impl#1-legacy newline shape (S469, dpa-073 F5): pins impl#1's continuation of a single-expression arm body past a line break that ends in `+` (`.Boom(m) :> \"a:\" +⏎ m,`). The arm-comma codemod (f0c9d4bb7) gave the arm list its commas, and under §7.2.2 rule 4 the join is also the ruled reading. The bootstrap does not grade the case because of its legacy `<out> : string` cell and top-level markup (E-PARSE-ITEM, E-BOOTSTRAP-UNSUPPORTED, E-PROGRAM-MISSING), not because of the arm. Kept unmigrated so impl#1's legacy reading stays guarded; not a bootstrap input."}
